38868>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38869>>>
38869>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38869>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
38870>>>        WebSet pbRender of oSaveBtn to False
38871>>>        WebSet pbRender of oCancelChangesBtn to False
